Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Credits,,0,0,0,,CREDITS
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SIGNS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.09,0:00:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}American planetary exploration satellite, Voyager 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...passed by Jupiter and Saturn, capturing beautiful\Nphotos and significantly boosting our scientific knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These events are still recent in people's memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, in 1986...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Voyager 2 has gone past Uranus and departed into the\Nabyss of space, carrying our message of peace and friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.37,0:00:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All the while, humanity kept launching numerous artificial satellites...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.31,0:00:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...many of those made with a hostile intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:02:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.15,0:03:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be spending a long time in close company. Glad to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you stop by my quarters? \NI brought a bottle of rare wine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.11,0:03:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. The previous political\Ncommissar we had was insufferably straight-laced.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the two of us will get along much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.69,0:03:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a wireless operator, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, sir. I'm Seaman Apprentice Smirnov.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you receive a message starting\Nwith this password, let me know right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Let the eagles fly."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.65,0:04:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Michael? Dreaming about your girlfriend again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.03,0:04:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of, that cloud looks like a reclining woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got no girlfriend to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm missing my son and daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about it. We aren't going home any time soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.90,0:04:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Those damn Soviets are holding\N another large-scale drill right at our borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody, catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.11,0:04:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Up we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Get it!\N-Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.05,0:05:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.95,0:05:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-Stop!\N-Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait!\N-Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.61,0:05:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Emergency bogey. Over.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:06:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A warning to the Soviet bomber.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your present course will imminently\Ncause you to violate Japanese airspace.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.69,0:06:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Change your course this instant.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A warning to the Soviet bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.57,0:06:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You've already violated Japanese airspace. Turn back right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Captain, should we open fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Captain, I thought you were going to actually ram it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't joke about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}F15 fighters are crucial for protecting\NJapan's skies. We can't afford pointless losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:08:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Inspection of precise aiming system, complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Opening precise aiming system's test circuit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.15,0:08:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintenance on experimental satellite, complete.\NRetrieving Professor Brown and Engineer Mikumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.81,0:08:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hurry up. The dummy missile will be launched an hour from now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Opening the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.39,0:08:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Retrieval, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.14,0:08:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shutting the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru, how do you like your first spacewalk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's decent enough.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Better than my trips to L.A. and Tokyo, at least.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.69,0:09:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If not for all the boldness, I'd consider you a hardcore optimist.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.57,0:09:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, so good—let's take it easy\Nfor now. The rest depends on God alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.06,0:09:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The god of peace? Or perhaps...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The god of war?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura, I refuse to believe in some god of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.08,0:09:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, a high-intensity laser is powerful enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...to punch through the armor on\Nspace-bound targets up to 5000 km away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Assuming this experiment succeeds...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...the very concept of nuclear warfare using\NICBMs would have to be revised from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.97,0:09:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{uchuu boukuu shireibu to mirai kagaku kenkyuujou no erinukareta gijutsushatachi ga 20-nen no saizetsu to bakudai na hiyou}This project required extensive funding and 20 years of research.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{uchuu boukuu shireibu to mirai kagaku kenkyuujou no erinukareta gijutsushatachi ga 20-nen no saizetsu to bakudai na hiyou}Results produced by the Space Defense Center\Nand the Future Research Institute's elite scientists...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.29,0:09:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...will now be brought to the test,\Nwith American prestige hanging on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:10:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, a combat satellite moving at Mach 26...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...is supposed to intercept a missile flying at the same\Nspeed at the range measured in thousands of kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The likeliness of a direct hit is said to be 6 in 100,000.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.95,0:10:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I struggle to find the right words\Nto convey the sheer difficulty of this task.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:17.16,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,How long would it take for a missile\Nthat was launched from Alaska to reach us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,About 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.94,0:10:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to worry about, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The missile is intended to land in the middle of a desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:28.74,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,If the experiment fails, should I perhaps\Nhave a keyholder made out of the wreckage?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:33.17,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,The Kremlin is attentively watching\Nthis test, too. A failure is out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. President, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.17,0:11:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Locked onto the target. Distance: 3800 km.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Angular velocity: 2 micro-radians\Nper second. Beginning target tracking.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Attitude control, complete. Injecting uranium pellets.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let us down, baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.41,0:11:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Distance: 2500 km.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.41,0:11:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Angular velocity: 4.5 micro-radians\Nper second. Preparing to activate the laser.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Engaging precise targeting system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Activating laser. Switch, on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.57,0:11:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.39,0:12:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-{\i1}Got it! Right on target!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.81,0:12:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.84,0:12:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief. The President's calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.62,0:12:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Bart. Great job.{note, could be Bert or Burt too. Your call.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.11,0:12:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're truly the William Tell of the space age.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.66,0:12:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow you launched will protect\Nthe world from the looming threat of nuclear war.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Secretary of State would like\Nto congratulate you, too. I'm passing you over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Gerald speaking. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.39,0:12:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I bow my head to your talent and strenuous effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.23,0:12:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As of now, the space above the\NWestern Bloc is effectively under our control.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up your hard work,\Nand put more combat satellites into orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:13:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Keep up your hard work,\Nand put more combat satellites into orbit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.65,0:14:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.29,0:14:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Laura.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.86,0:14:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.39,0:14:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad it worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job. I appreciate your efforts.\NExcellent results for the first day of testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the precise targeting's margin of error is too large. We failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:15:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's either the servomotors or the signal processing circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If we made the attitude control data link computer more compact...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd certainly improve the accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you to continue the research.\NThis kind of work must be easy to do in Japanese laboratories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at least a year away from a working prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.43,0:15:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.23,0:15:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...perhaps even two years...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The President has already placed\Na large order on the laser combat satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.77,0:15:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pushing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The race to space supremacy is unforgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to conduct yesterday's test in secrecy,\Nbut the government overturned my request.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.55,0:15:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In terms of nuclear armaments, America's far behind the Soviet Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.18,0:15:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the Soviet research on the beam weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.47,0:15:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Electronics-wise, there's a significant gap between us and them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.19,0:15:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The technology that Wataru works with is the best there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.14,0:15:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Soviets have nobody comparable to Bart Gain. That's our ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.98,0:16:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But wouldn't our latest test escalate the war instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.35,0:16:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kremlin might take it as a provocation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As if you understand politics! Watch your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.23,0:16:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfecting our defense systems is a must. \NIt's the only way to avoid an all-out war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.22,0:16:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Laser technology is the only trump card we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.94,0:16:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura, could you play the usual melody for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be good for us to take our minds off\Nof that outburst. Your music would lighten the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.65,0:16:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If something happens to me, take care of Laura.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.15,0:17:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bart...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura doesn't even remember our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She may seem like a strong-willed woman, \Nbut she's really just pampered and starved for love.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.96,0:18:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me, I'd like to rest now. Make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Bart, I'm sorry. I shouldn't have spoken out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's me who should be apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking after our late father, with the\Ngrumpiness and all. I'll try to keep my temper in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.98,0:18:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.17,0:18:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Bart's so tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.82,0:18:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If the worst comes to pass...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason you became a space pilot\Nwas to be able to work with Bart, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He hates war from the bottom of his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost many of his lifelong\Nfriends in Vietnam and in the Middle East.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You Japanese have it good these days...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you treat me to a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.87,0:20:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying at the sidelines is no good. Let's join in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.35,0:20:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't half bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.36,0:20:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How long has it been since the last time...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I've wanted to get closer to you for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Name's Moira Hackett.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you, Wataru Mikumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.66,0:20:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the most likely to win gold\Nin judo at the Moscow Olympics five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.98,0:20:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was the American champion at the sprint hurdles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.44,0:21:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I broke down in tears when the news about the boycott broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.45,0:21:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course, that's all in the past now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Listen, would you stop by my place later tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.18,0:21:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop by my place... later tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.25,0:21:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so dense!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.43,0:21:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How typical of the Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cars...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.65,0:21:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Computers...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Television...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.49,0:21:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And even disco dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you capitalizing on every single American achievement?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.12,0:21:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've even taken interest in missiles and space weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.23,0:21:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Spoken like a typical American.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.27,0:21:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Americans are liberal, honest, and wonderful people, overall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.09,0:21:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,However, they won't rest easy\Nunless they're the best nation in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.80,0:21:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll try to pull others down, under the pretense of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:22:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That self-righteousness will eventually\Nspell America's downfall. Don't you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.82,0:22:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you. She turned you down on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.20,0:22:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.68,0:22:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.92,0:22:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoover, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.80,0:22:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, you accompanied Chief Bart \Nfrom the Future Research Institute, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.88,0:22:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.74,0:22:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.91,0:22:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Kidnapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.03,0:22:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody ambushed him early this morning, on the way to the Institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.91,0:22:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Three of his bodyguards have\Nbeen killed, and the Chief himself went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.87,0:23:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura... You came here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.35,0:23:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You should rest, or else you'll fall ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.48,0:23:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bart will be fine. Even the Soviets aren't so—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.65,0:23:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Americans will kill Bart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.47,0:23:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?! Don't even joke about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.22,0:24:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Bart is America's treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, how long until we reach Vladivostok?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.32,0:24:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,About five hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.25,0:24:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep him sedated for another three\Ndays and nights until he's brought to Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.79,0:24:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.60,0:24:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.19,0:24:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.29,0:25:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Captain! An enemy assault aircraft is closing in!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.02,0:25:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dive to 1500 meters!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.25,0:25:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.36,0:25:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The torpedoes couldn't reach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.27,0:25:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy nuclear sub is undeniably a refurbished Alfa-type.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.81,0:25:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It can reach a constant speed of\N50 knots, and dive to a depth of 1500 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.47,0:25:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're unable to counter it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.75,0:25:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, what do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.02,0:25:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we let the laser technology's\Nsecrets fall into the enemy's hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.11,0:25:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Using a nuclear torpedo is our last and only resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.48,0:25:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A nuclear torpedo?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.07,0:25:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we really use a nuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.32,0:25:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A nuclear torpedo will make short work of\Nany submarine, no matter how deep it dives.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.60,0:25:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Bart...?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.08,0:25:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Acceptable losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.41,0:26:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,For the cover story, we must insist on\Nthe submarine blowing up due to an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.11,0:26:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A nuclear submarine blowing up would seem like business as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.70,0:26:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.54,0:26:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kremlin won't buy it. A war will break out if we mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.32,0:26:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. President, we await your decision. There's less than two hours left.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.41,0:26:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go with this, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.61,0:26:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gerald...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.32,0:26:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,However conflicted you may feel,\Nit's your job to approve or decline such proposals.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.65,0:26:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, we've conducted\Na few hundred nuclear tests in the Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.29,0:26:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A measly nuclear torpedo won't change\Nanything now. So why are you holding back?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.17,0:26:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A measly nuclear torpedo...?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.82,0:26:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this incident won't blow out of control...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.87,0:27:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy nuclear submarine is approaching an underwater ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.35,0:27:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. Let's take it out right there. The wreckage won't surface, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.93,0:27:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to release nuclear torpedo Mk-48.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.58,0:27:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparing to release nuclear torpedo Mk-48.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.86,0:27:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Release.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.98,0:27:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Releasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.71,0:28:32.08,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,Are you certain that our nuclear submarine has been\Ndestroyed by the American Navy's nuclear torpedo?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.08,0:28:33.77,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.77,0:28:38.86,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,Radiation-contaminated fish washed up\Noff the coast of Japan's Tohoku region...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.86,0:28:40.95,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,...which caused a huge scandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.95,0:28:44.38,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,Comrade Orlov, this is the perfect pretext for a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.38,0:28:50.12,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,We could publicly announce that America\Nused a nuke, then stage a retaliation attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.12,0:28:52.81,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,And nobody would have the gall to blame us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.82,0:28:57.18,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,Exactly. Victory's certain if we start the war now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.18,0:29:04.25,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,But in a year from now, American nuclear armament will reach\Na level on par with ours. The outcome won't be as clear, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.29,0:29:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're underestimating America too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.55,0:29:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't give in that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.93,0:29:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to force them into submission.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.73,0:29:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If the death count piles up to 20-30 million...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.17,0:29:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,...those yankees would be shocked senseless, \Nand force their president to raise a white flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.59,0:29:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And if that's still not enough to scare them,\Nkilling a hundred million will do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.41,0:29:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.91,0:29:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like you're possessed by Hitler's vengeful spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.32,0:29:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Comrade Orlov?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.55,0:29:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We ought to start the war while we still have a chance to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.04,0:29:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Presently, our nuclear stockpile exceeds whatever the Americans have.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.76,0:29:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a break for the next hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.99,0:30:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense Minister Bugarin is a dangerous man. \NWe must take measures accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.56,0:30:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Our failure to procure the secrets of\Nthe laser raised a wave of objections as is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.11,0:30:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Bugarin is right in his assessment of our chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.98,0:30:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our food and oil supplies are dwindling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.30,0:30:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We've reached the point of relying on external support to make ends meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.20,0:30:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Our country's weather conditions are extremely harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.05,0:30:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our satellite states have fallen into abject poverty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.98,0:30:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we start a war, mutual destruction is inevitable!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.17,0:30:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.83,0:30:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Comrade Orlov. A Christmas present\Nfrom the American President Gibson has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.53,0:30:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Open it.\N-Wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.86,0:30:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, it's not a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.30,0:31:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"Merry Christmas to Chairman Orlov."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.50,0:31:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"With a wish for peace and a faith in our lasting friendship, J. Gibson."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.91,0:31:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"With a wish for peace," eh? How bold of that deceitful cowboy...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I must add, though, that this aroma is superb as usual.\NI nearly lost my sense of reason, but this brings it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.84,0:31:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnarev, send him a letter with my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.62,0:31:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, the usual caviar to return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.73,0:31:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The message from the sturgeons to the cowboys should read:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.22,0:31:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"This year, the affairs might become much more heated."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.17,0:33:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, the transmission stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.01,0:33:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spy satellite has undoubtedly\Nbeen destroyed by a Soviet killer satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.58,0:33:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A killer satellite?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.65,0:33:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{teki no eisei ga space shuttle wo taiatari de hakai suru kogata no mujin sentou eisei des}A light, unmanned enemy combat satellite\Ndesigned to destroy space shuttles by ramming into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.81,0:33:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm vaguely aware of that project, \Nbut I can't believe they deployed it already...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.68,0:33:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{daitouryou kakka, europe chuukintou kyokutou-chiku ni okeru Soren-gun no doukou to awasete, waga kuni mo junsenji taisei ni hairubeki ka to kangaemasu}Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.27,0:33:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,In response to the Soviets massing their armed\Nforces in Europe, the Middle East, and the Far East...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.49,0:33:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe we should switch to a quasi-wartime economy.{also see 準戦時体制}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.37,0:33:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What does Orlov have on his mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.86,0:33:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he serious about fighting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.61,0:33:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of outer space, it's already eat or be eaten.\NIn order to promptly respond to any possible threats...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.93,0:33:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...we must hasten the deployment of the\Nmanned satellites equipped with high-output lasers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.10,0:33:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only means to secure space supremacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.60,0:34:31.27,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shin Nippon Seiki Co., Ltd.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.85,0:34:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mikumo. You have a confidential call\Nfrom Chief Brown of the Future Institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.53,0:34:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, Wataru. It's been a while.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.78,0:34:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.38,0:34:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.36,0:34:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've received the data you sent yesterday.\NGood job. Your team's engineering is top-notch.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.91,0:34:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say I've fully solved the issues Bart left us with.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.20,0:35:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could you come to America right away?\N I have a much more important assignment waiting for you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.96,0:35:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd like to officially welcome you as our new Engineering Section Chief.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.87,0:35:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The thing is, I've received a special order from the President.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.35,0:35:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We must produce five units within six months.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.67,0:35:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know this is a tall order, but we have no choice.\NI've already received an okay from Chief Oshiro.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.57,0:35:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint you, but I intend to return\Nto my usual work once the current project is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.57,0:35:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know that Bart's death shocked you deeply.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.47,0:35:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, Bart's most important legacy, his genius, resides in your head.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.76,0:35:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your knowledge is needed not only for\NAmerica and Japan, but to protect all of the free world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.17,0:35:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come to America as soon as you can. Is this clear?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.24,0:35:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This woman pilot is Laura Gain,\None of the famous American space pilots.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.69,0:36:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}During her vacation to Japan, her plane \Nran out of fuel while she was sightseeing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.40,0:36:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We believe she crash-landed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.33,0:36:15.33,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hachinohe General Hospital{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.77,0:36:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.95,0:36:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Laura.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.92,0:36:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.08,0:36:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here to laugh at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.76,0:36:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you say that, Laura?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.13,0:36:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He came here all the way from Tokyo for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.72,0:36:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Mikumo, Bart told me about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.70,0:36:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Laura's uncle and the American\Nambassador to Japan, Roger Hamilton.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.75,0:36:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura boarded that light aircraft\Nto see the area of the ocean Bart died in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.11,0:37:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,While her physical wounds are light,\Nthe wounds to her soul run very deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.85,0:37:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's not too much to ask, could you by chance comfort her?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.20,0:37:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been called back to Tokyo on short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.35,0:37:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll keep her company.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.15,0:37:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please watch over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.91,0:37:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.96,0:37:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This hospital is weighing down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.02,0:37:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.09,0:37:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your medical records.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.02,0:37:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be tended to with utmost care\Nas this hospital's first ever American patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.40,0:37:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.83,0:37:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to Japan in order to apologize to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.42,0:37:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.87,0:37:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I was mildly suspicious of you after Bart's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.37,0:37:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.94,0:37:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I deserve to have simply drowned in the ocean...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.55,0:38:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'd be able to meet Bart again...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.29,0:38:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That would've brought him sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.14,0:38:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I remember Bart, I feel like I'm slowly going insane...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.17,0:38:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He devoted his life to America. That's how strongly he loved it...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.24,0:38:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simply unbearable!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.60,0:38:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a doll from my hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.97,0:38:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.08,0:38:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That snowy and quiet town is where my parents live.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.32,0:38:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you pay them a visit with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.62,0:38:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd like me to meet them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.44,0:38:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.87,0:38:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're fine with it...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.76,0:39:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.58,0:39:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.26,0:39:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.77,0:39:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.65,0:39:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want your pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.61,0:39:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying this out of pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.43,0:39:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I truly love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.08,0:40:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The blizzard's raging outside. Was it hard getting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.48,0:40:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.33,0:40:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Scotland, my homeland, lies farther to the North.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.94,0:40:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, you'd better stay inside, considering the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.26,0:40:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, let him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.47,0:40:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael is on his long-awaited Christmas leave, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.27,0:40:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.96,0:40:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.29,0:40:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Does it look good on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.44,0:40:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.40,0:40:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.08,0:41:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, Mommy, I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.17,0:41:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.11,0:41:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.60,0:41:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.87,0:41:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.83,0:41:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.11,0:41:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.18,0:41:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.63,0:42:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't recognize that model.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.69,0:42:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, could it by chance be...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.85,0:42:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...the Soviet Black Dragon—that elusive\Nfighter-bomber equipped with cutting-edge electronics?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.70,0:42:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're right, this is a major incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.09,0:43:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.43,0:43:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Captain Boris of the Soviet Air Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.25,0:43:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I request the government of\NWest Germany to grant me asylum. Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.69,0:43:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.34,0:43:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The blizzard caused us to lose track of the target during the test flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.85,0:43:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe it landed at the Air Force base in West Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.76,0:43:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the pilot defect?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.99,0:43:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Boris is our ace. Him defecting is inconceivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.96,0:43:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Comrade Orlov. Cutting-edge electronics,\Nwhich the Black Dragon is equipped with...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.92,0:43:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,...are our ultimate secret weapon. \NOur Air Force's future depends on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.87,0:43:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We must take urgent measures, or else this will turn into a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.01,0:43:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll assuredly steal our secrets if we ask them\Nto give back the fighter. Destroying it is the only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.25,0:43:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,America has destroyed our nuclear\Nsubmarine with a nuclear torpedo. Likewise...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.37,0:43:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying it's okay for us to launch a nuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.31,0:43:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.20,0:44:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.67,0:44:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's destroy that fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.82,0:44:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,However, only the fighter and the pilot are to be dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.75,0:44:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I despise Gibson's heavy-handed methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.88,0:44:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible...!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.51,0:44:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.28,0:44:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This incident happened due to your incompetence!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.82,0:44:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soldiers can't be relied upon, \Nso you're raring to charge in with bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.60,0:44:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.37,0:44:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He defected, without a doubt.\NOur Air Force has deteriorated {\i1}this{\i0}{\i0\fsp16} {\fsp0}much!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.20,0:44:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes them run away?\NWhat is it they find so alluring on the other side...?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.87,0:44:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the luxury? The freedom? Those are nothing but illusions!{/As if those things can be found *anywhere!*}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.38,0:44:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Those absolute fools...!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.71,0:44:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Comrade Orlov!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.03,0:44:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Anyone out there?\N-Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.15,0:44:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-A doctor! We need a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.71,0:44:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.20,0:44:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.38,0:45:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Edelweiss, edelweiss, every morning you greet me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.03,0:45:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Small and white, clean and bright, you look happy to meet me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.16,0:45:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Blossom of snow, may you bloom and grow, bloom and grow forever...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.78,0:45:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.21,0:45:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.05,0:45:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?\N-What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.49,0:45:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.84,0:45:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.63,0:45:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, Michael...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.12,0:45:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that black monster we saw bring a disaster upon us?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.63,0:45:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Marlene. I'm here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.08,0:45:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible, guys! The whole airfield is aflame!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.18,0:45:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A surprise attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.19,0:46:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.61,0:46:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming in for a hard landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.09,0:46:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter. Shoot it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.54,0:47:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.87,0:47:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy airborne forces\Nstaged a surprise attack! We need suppo—
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.72,0:47:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What happened, Richter? What's going on?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.02,0:47:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.80,0:48:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you okay, Gerhardt?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.00,0:48:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.96,0:48:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What now, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.43,0:48:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We can't let them get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.74,0:48:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.38,0:48:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An urgent message to all command centers in West Germany!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.75,0:48:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Soviet Air Force's assault units staged a surprise attack\Nagainst West Germany! NATO forces must counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.58,0:49:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sir, enemy fighters sighted!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.63,0:49:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.04,0:49:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's an enemy Air Force base\Nten miles from here. That's our target.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.15,0:49:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}See? There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.07,0:49:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.77,0:49:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.25,0:49:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to America next, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.85,0:49:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Our research is about to bear fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.72,0:49:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.95,0:49:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.67,0:49:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,When are you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.84,0:49:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.58,0:50:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight...?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.15,0:50:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This will take about a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.67,0:50:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,When I come back, let's have a\Nceremony with the Ambassador's blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.52,0:50:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful sunset...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.39,0:50:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, we'll never see it ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.71,0:50:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I feel all of a sudden...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.81,0:50:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You still don't want to come back to America?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.02,0:50:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to submit a request for military retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.41,0:50:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to study Japanese customs in your absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.41,0:51:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.34,0:51:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, war has broken out in Europe!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.33,0:51:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.20,0:51:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mechanized forces of the Warsaw Pact\NArmies crossed the border without warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.48,0:51:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{北部平原地帯}Presently, NATO Defense Forces are continuing\Nto fight on the Northern Plains of West Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.10,0:51:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it... We'll never see that sunset again...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.57,0:52:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru! Please, reconsider going to America!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.75,0:52:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run away, right now, as far as we can go!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.85,0:52:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if we run to the ends\Nof the Earth, as long as there's no war!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.86,0:52:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura, what's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.32,0:52:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.58,0:52:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Americans killed Bart! The same will happen to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.52,0:52:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I lose you too, I won't be able...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.02,0:52:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.78,0:52:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to take upon Bart's legacy.\NThat's the only choice left for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.04,0:52:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, will you come with me? \NI want you to stay by my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.53,0:52:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What... What the hell are you thinking? You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.10,0:52:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Bart trusted neither the White House nor\Nthe Kremlin. That's why he devoted himself to science.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.87,0:52:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The world would truly meet its end if\Nit were left to politicians and generals. That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.11,0:52:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.77,0:52:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you hope to accomplish on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.65,0:52:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my calling!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.38,0:52:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the extent of your love, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.68,0:52:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a brave and wonderful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.84,0:53:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I don't want this love of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.97,0:53:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weighing down on me! I can't keep up with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.60,0:53:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru, please say it straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.29,0:53:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Between me and your job, which will you pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.75,0:53:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.19,0:53:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.80,0:53:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.27,0:53:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll follow my own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.68,0:53:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So be it. I'm going by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.12,0:53:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I won't say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.24,0:53:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Our love will only grow stronger the farther we drift apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.83,0:53:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, we'll see the sun rise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.15,0:54:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Marlene!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.05,0:54:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Marlene!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.10,0:54:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.62,0:54:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Marlene...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.02,0:54:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Marlene!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.29,0:54:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Marlene! Stay with me, Marlene!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.81,0:54:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Marlene! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.17,0:55:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me, Marlene!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.24,0:55:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.27,0:55:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised to see Scotland with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.03,0:55:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom sent me letters! She was looking forward to meeting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.01,0:55:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Marlene! Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.03,0:58:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Still nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.53,0:58:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't Orlov picking up?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.60,0:58:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's taking him so long? Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.12,0:58:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not answering? Cease your nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.33,0:58:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Use all available channels! Get through to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.33,0:58:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't they start this with his approval?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.59,0:58:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That damned Russian bear! \NDon't you dare claim to be hibernating...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.57,0:58:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something unexpected happen in the Kremlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.50,0:59:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Their recent politics are strikingly out of character for Orlov.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.27,0:59:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me Ambassador Wood in Moscow!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.14,0:59:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Orlov has a heart defect.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.21,0:59:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If that war hawk, Bugarin, consolidated control...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.57,0:59:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Destruction awaits us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.99,0:59:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.07,0:59:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,McCoy, the Chairman of the Joint Chiefs\Nof Staff from the Pentagon, is calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.65,0:59:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.17,0:59:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The commander of the NATO forces, \NLindsay, wants to talk to you directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.83,0:59:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm switching over.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.90,0:59:33.60,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,Mr. President.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.60,0:59:38.80,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,At present, intense fighting is continuing\Nin the northern regions of West Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.80,0:59:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The advancing mechanized enemy forces number about 30,000.\NLaunching a tactical nuke is the only way we can stave them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.28,0:59:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already received the okay from the NATO member\Nnations' representatives, including the UK and West Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.45,0:59:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. President, we need your approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.48,0:59:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Lindsay. I'm trying to reach\Nthe Kremlin by the hotline as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.88,1:00:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. President, we're in no position to negotiate a ceasefire!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.36,1:00:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Three hours from now, the enemies will force a crossing of the Weser!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.12,1:00:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to wait, and wait you will.\NAn hour... no, even ten minutes will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.31,1:00:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I made myself clear, Lindsay? Stand by!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.84,1:00:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael! What took you so long?! You absolute moron!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.78,1:00:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay off him, Patts!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.59,1:00:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, we're retreating to the Weser. You drive the launcher!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.52,1:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get moving, you imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.76,1:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy tanks are less than ten kilometers from here!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.96,1:01:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that, Michael. Now turn around and drive back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.66,1:01:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Michael! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.58,1:01:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're driving towards the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.56,1:01:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard went off the rails...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.94,1:02:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Edelweiss, edelweiss...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.20,1:03:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...every morning you greet me...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.03,1:03:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"Let the eagles fly."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.12,1:03:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.34,1:03:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A direct order from General Secretary Orlov!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.68,1:03:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,An all-out war against America is likely to begin within the next 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.08,1:03:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the missiles on stand-by.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.39,1:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the situation deteriorate that much...?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.24,1:03:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it did.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.74,1:03:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The nukes that were launched the other day incinerated half of Europe.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.75,1:03:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And those scumbags from the West fired first!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.21,1:03:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Five of my friends have already died in action.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.74,1:03:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Major, sir... If we start a war\Nagainst America, will Ukraine be spared?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.11,1:04:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a wife and children in Kyiv.\NMy planned leave is scheduled for next month...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.69,1:04:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fighting to protect your wife and children, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.86,1:04:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get back to your post.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.42,1:04:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.31,1:04:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what our targets are?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.29,1:04:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the computer holds that information.\NThat's our one and only saving grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.32,1:04:35.12,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,-Run!\N-Get away from here!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.51,1:05:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The Soviet Union's end goal is access to Middle Eastern oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.59,1:05:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We've deployed a relief force twenty\Nthousand strong to Oman and Saudi Arabia.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.63,1:05:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're reinforced by the 7th Fleet from the Pacific, \Nin conjunction with the 3rd Marine Division from Okinawa.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.94,1:05:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.74,1:05:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Doesn't this leave Japan and the Pacific blatantly exposed?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.03,1:05:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.93,1:05:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsushima, Souya, and Tsugaru's straits are blocked with mines.\NVladivostok's Soviet Pacific Fleet has been locked in place.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.50,1:06:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Japanese fleet is greatly efficient in anti-submarine warfare.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.66,1:06:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the Soviet Far East forces stage an attack on Japan?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.04,1:06:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Prime Minister Mori, along with Ambassador\NHamilton, filed numerous requests for reinforcements, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.90,1:06:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, we can't spare any military forces for Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.93,1:06:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Japan is one of our crucial allies!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.86,1:06:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you help them somehow? What of the US-Japan Security Treaty?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.14,1:06:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. President, we cannot make decisions based on emotions alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.34,1:06:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Between Europe, the Middle East,\Nand Japan, which is most important to us?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.84,1:06:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer should be clear, considering their relative importance.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.19,1:06:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot protect three places at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.64,1:07:01.18,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,{soviet no houfuku, sankaikyou wo fuusa shita baai, Hokkaido senryou-sai jisanai to Soren seifu wa genmei shiteorimasu}The Soviets will retaliate.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.18,1:07:07.00,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,Now that the three straits are blocked, we must\Nbe ready to defend Hokkaido from Soviet occupation.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.00,1:07:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They're seething with malignancy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.03,1:07:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We mustn't surrender!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.05,1:07:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But, them being as strong as they are...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.91,1:07:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you say, Mr. Touno?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.22,1:07:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Will the Soviets really strike at Hokkaido?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.21,1:07:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe their assault is unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.05,1:07:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,However, presumption that Hokkaido is the most \Nlikely target leaves our defense in a perilous state.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.89,1:07:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where else could they possibly strike?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.36,1:07:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Regrettably, Tokyo is the most probable target.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.54,1:07:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Japan has very few natural resources, and little\Nvalue territory-wise. If we're targeted by a Soviet attack...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.27,1:07:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,...America would perceive it as a strategic diversion.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.03,1:07:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To the West Bloc at large, such an attack\Nwould be nothing more than a minor inconvenience.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.17,1:07:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering a push in Hokkaido is guaranteed\Nto invite enormous casualties among the attackers...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.22,1:07:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...a surprise attack on Tokyo appears more sound.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.21,1:08:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Presently, substantial amounts of airborne troops​\Nand a sniper corps are stationed at Soviet Air Bases.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.79,1:08:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We appreciate your sharp assessment of modern warfare.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.91,1:08:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With you serving as Joint Staff Chairman, the JSDF's combat\Neffectiveness has increased greatly compared to the '70s.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.04,1:08:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,An attack against our capital won't be that easy to pull off, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.45,1:08:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,To begin with, if the Soviets attacked Tokyo,\NAmerica wouldn't leave it unanswered.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.73,1:08:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what a total war is about.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.77,1:08:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think the Soviets will proceed with such a risky endeavor.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.22,1:08:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Japan is already as good as erased from American war maps.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.92,1:08:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.21,1:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really so unexpected?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.62,1:08:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Treaties and alliances exist to be broken, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.72,1:08:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To protect our homeland, we have to rely solely on ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.74,1:08:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Partition of the Middle East?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.96,1:08:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.99,1:08:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As a condition for withdrawing his troops from Europe...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.42,1:08:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,...Orlov demands all the Middle Eastern territories north\Nof the 30th parallel to be transferred under his control.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.15,1:08:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be serious...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.63,1:08:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.79,1:09:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I c-can't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.61,1:09:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Such an absurd demand coming from Chairman Orlov...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.41,1:09:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ambassador, who handed you that memorandum?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.06,1:09:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Foreign Minister Kutuzov...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.62,1:09:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So you didn't speak to Orlov in person?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.12,1:09:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, he's made no public appearances in the last two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.13,1:09:19.87,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.87,1:09:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Orlov likely having a heart attack has been our line of thinking so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.69,1:09:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,However, this is undoubtedly his personal signature.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.00,1:09:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A signature can easily be forged!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.12,1:09:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.47,1:09:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The statements we presumed as coming from Chairman Orlov...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.14,1:09:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...have actually been issued by Defense\NMinister Bugarin, who holds power at this point.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.67,1:09:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering his lower standing on the political ladder,\NKutuzov is powerless to keep Bugarin in check.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.26,1:09:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Comrades, there's no point in worrying.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.20,1:09:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the Soviet populace is fully aware how\Ndangerous Bugarin's ambitions of world conquest are.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.43,1:10:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In case only Bugarin is purged, the soldiers, the workers,\Nand the farmers would unanimously support our cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.88,1:10:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Secretary Saratov has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.29,1:10:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come right in, Comrade Saratov!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.81,1:10:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Comrade Kutuzov, I couldn't have\Nimagined that you were such a filthy traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.07,1:10:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How very unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.26,1:10:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Comrades, you are under arrest on the\Ncharges of treason against the Party and the State.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.07,1:10:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You sold us out!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.28,1:10:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bugarin, you're going to destroy the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.59,1:10:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, the fires you've started will burn you to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.07,1:10:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep this in mind!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.58,1:10:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A while ago, America rejected our\Nproposal for the division of the Middle East.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.67,1:11:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Gibson who stoked the fires, not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.91,1:11:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The world's going to change, and you'll live\Nto see it from the window of your prison cell.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.75,1:11:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Flash, Bogey, Mast Head.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.77,1:11:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Headed east to south-east at Mach 0.8.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.30,1:11:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Their present location is N36. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.10,1:11:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Numerous enemy Air Force units headed for the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.64,1:11:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An attack on Tokyo is likely.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.51,1:11:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All units, prepare to intercept.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.03,1:11:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Civil Defense HQ has issued an air raid\Nalert for Kantou, Toukai, and Hokuriku.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.27,1:12:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.31,1:13:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen!\NAn air raid alert has been issued throughout Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.22,1:13:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please evacuate to the designated bomb shelters.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.47,1:13:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Soviet planes are coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.01,1:13:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-They'll drop a nuke!\N-Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.13,1:13:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura, we're leaving!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.63,1:15:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokyo will fall within the next 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.29,1:15:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Paris will fall shortly after.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.39,1:15:24.25,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,Baghdad and Tehran are the real problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.25,1:15:29.50,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,America is putting all their efforts into staging\Na counterattack. Our forces are being pushed back.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.50,1:15:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Use our reserves around the\NPersian Gulf to launch an attack on Baghdad.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.67,1:15:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we weaken our forces stationed on the Turkish border?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.52,1:15:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in their sane mind would do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.04,1:15:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what it takes, the American\NPresident must be brought to his knees by the 25th.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.81,1:15:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, by the anniversary of the\NSoviet Revolutionary Government establishment.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.18,1:15:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,An urgent message from the Far East Military District HQ.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.87,1:15:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chinese North-East Army's 20th Division has crossed\Nthe border near Iman and Lesozavodsk, and continues to advance.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.56,1:15:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,An urgent message from the Zabaikalye HQ.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.44,1:16:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chinese Army's 35th Division crossed the border at Dauriya\Nnear Choibalsan. They're fighting the Mongolian Defense Forces.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.27,1:16:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,China has made its move. It's about time to launch the nukes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.29,1:16:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,An urgent message from the Cuban Government.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.19,1:16:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The American Air Force has bombed Havana.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.68,1:16:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The 2nd Marines Battalion has landed.\NPresently, they're fighting the Cuban army.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.08,1:16:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Have you managed to clarify the situation?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.54,1:16:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering the intensity of the jamming, that won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.49,1:16:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The events are unfolding on the surface. Captain, let's try surfacing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.65,1:16:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we'll be playing into the enemy's hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.45,1:16:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Set those concerns aside for now!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.91,1:16:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to receive up-to-date information as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.67,1:16:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been 13 days since the last order from General Secretary Orlov.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.21,1:16:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We may be the only remaining survivors by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.81,1:17:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,An incoming transmission from Cuba...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.96,1:17:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a speech by President Garcia...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.71,1:17:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Havana's been destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.61,1:17:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The entirety of Cuba's engulfed in fire?!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.62,1:17:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Avenge the fallen! Avenge the fallen!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.99,1:17:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, d-did our homeland suffer the same fate?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.13,1:17:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Enemy submarine detected! General quarters!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.88,1:17:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Torpedoes incoming. Distance: 1000.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.86,1:17:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dive! Ready the decoy torpedoes!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.08,1:17:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Diving. Readying decoy torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.93,1:17:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.19,1:18:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the enemy torpedoes keeps approaching!\NSecond wave of torpedoes incoming from the stern!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.59,1:18:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep launching the decoy torpedoes!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.65,1:18:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Launching decoy torpedoes!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.33,1:18:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad! They're too close—the decoys are ineffective!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.85,1:18:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.39,1:18:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a damage report!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.98,1:18:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow torpedo tubes damaged! Taking water in through the breach!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.31,1:18:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin repairs at once!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.73,1:18:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Communications and engine\Ncompartments flooded! Repairs impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.83,1:18:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Emergency surfacing! Prepare the lifeboats!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.30,1:18:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nastya...!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.74,1:18:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, the time has come.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.64,1:19:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's launch the SLBMs.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.66,1:19:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell I will!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.44,1:19:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stayed on the previous course,\Nnone of this would have happened!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.69,1:19:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over your key.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.69,1:19:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you confirmed the order with the political bureau?!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.00,1:19:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That transmission from Cuba is enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.12,1:19:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world is already at war!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.44,1:19:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't launch the SLBMs without \NGeneral Secretary Orlov's direct order!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.25,1:19:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard! Don't you care if our\NFatherland gets destroyed by American missiles?!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.80,1:19:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this! You're sorely mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.38,1:19:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.51,1:20:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.35,1:20:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,2... 1... 0!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.34,1:20:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.40,1:20:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Four SLBMs have been launched from our nuclear\Nsubmarine Rurik, which is currently in the Atlantic.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.45,1:20:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Within the next ten minutes, Washington D.C. will be hit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.36,1:20:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Comrade Bugarin...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.04,1:21:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.26,1:21:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Intercept them! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.78,1:21:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop wasting time! Shoot them down!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.05,1:21:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The interceptor missiles have been launched. \NThe distance is too short—they won't make it in time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.45,1:21:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What...? And you call yourselves pros?\NWhat are we spending such an exorbitant amount of money on?!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.61,1:21:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A nuclear emergency evacuation\Norder in the affected areas has been issued.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.55,1:21:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A countrywide emergency alarm has also been issued.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.64,1:21:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Strategic Air Force has already begun\Nthe countdown to the launch-on-warning stance.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.47,1:21:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Engage the launch switch for the missiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.60,1:21:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Engaging launch switch for the missiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.79,1:21:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Engage the MX pre-launch switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.45,1:21:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,MX, standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.65,1:21:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Launch preparation, complete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.27,1:21:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Set!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.18,1:21:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Set, affirmative.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.65,1:22:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}However, judging by the available information, the launches\N from the Soviet nuclear submarine might have been accidental.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.25,1:22:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Neumann... Be it an accident or\Na tragic coincidence, there's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.02,1:22:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who dares to tarnish \Nthe glory of the USA, they won't get away with it!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.70,1:22:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I order a retaliation strike, effective immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.34,1:22:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger that, Mr. President.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.63,1:22:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You did the right thing, John. This is how it should be.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.40,1:22:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Bill, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.84,1:23:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,3... 2... 1... 0...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.05,1:23:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.78,1:23:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Multiple missile signatures on the radar!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.35,1:23:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}America has launched numerous ICBMs.\NPresence of exhaust gases, confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.01,1:24:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, Comrade Bugarin.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.66,1:24:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pressing that button is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.63,1:24:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've already pushed the override button in my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.35,1:24:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Comrade Orlov!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.62,1:24:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Comrades. Despite being on the verge of death...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.20,1:24:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've come to my office to give you one final order.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.01,1:24:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We must not launch a retaliatory nuclear strike against America.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.59,1:24:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But the American ICBMs are,\Nat this very moment, headed for our homeland!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.02,1:24:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.23,1:24:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the first wave is likely to be targeted at our military bases.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.27,1:24:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Though we may lose the means of\Nwaging war, I'll consider that an honorable defeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.08,1:24:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We've managed to reach Gibson via the hotline.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.24,1:24:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've managed to reach Gibson via the hotline.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.14,1:24:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll talk it over. He's bound to understand me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.64,1:25:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you been doing all\Nthis time? Why didn't you call me sooner?!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.94,1:25:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies, President Gibson.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.23,1:25:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been crippled by my illness to the point that I couldn't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.30,1:25:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But God, in all his mercy, has lit one last spark of life in this old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.82,1:25:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Being a politician, this is a chance to atone for\N my sins before the people of the whole world—
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.19,1:26:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The cities that have suffered nuclear strikes include:{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.34,1:27:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Washington D.C. and New York, as well as Chicago and the suburbs of L.A.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.50,1:27:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the last two cases, ICBMs deviated off their trajectory.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.63,1:27:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Five military bases in total have been hit,\N including Grand Forks, Malmstrom, and Pointman.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.53,1:27:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Estimated casualties are 15 to 20 million.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.17,1:27:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.67,1:27:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Devote all your energy to the rescue efforts.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.55,1:27:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.49,1:27:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,15 to 20 million, you say?\NAs if five million is a negligible difference...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.62,1:27:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the professionals' cold reasoning? What a load of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.12,1:27:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damage assessment for the Allied countries is ready.\NLondon, Paris, Bonn, Tokyo, and Beijing have been hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.15,1:27:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The estimated death count is—
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.73,1:27:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. President, this is McCoy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.43,1:27:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We received a transmission from Vandenberg.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.51,1:28:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The enemy ICBM veered off its trajectory. The base is unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.30,1:28:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Four combat satellites equipped with laser\Ncannons, the Space Rangers, are ready to launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.60,1:28:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see them off upon launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.55,1:28:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But that's dangerous!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.58,1:28:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind the danger.\NThe only pros I can rely upon are the Space Rangers.{note, "Space Ranger" is used in a way that refers both to the laser satellites, and to the people piloting them}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.11,1:28:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll convey your sentiment to them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.00,1:28:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The pilots will board the rockets an hour and a half\Nbefore the launch. The 1st Unit's launch is scheduled for 6 AM.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.43,1:28:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All four units, along with the support space \Nshuttle Albatross, will launch by 1 AM tomorrow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.62,1:28:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Over and out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.64,1:28:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,John, our allies still have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.85,1:28:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stage a preemptive attack before the enemy launches the\Nsecond wave. We still have the MXs and the Tridents remaining.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.31,1:28:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Gerald, what attack are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.69,1:28:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Space Rangers reach orbit, \NI intend to order all forces to cease hostilities.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.79,1:28:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.75,1:28:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Before Orlov was murdered, he was trying to say the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.79,1:29:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could muster just a half of his idealism back then...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.91,1:29:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But we still have a chance. Humanity hasn't been\Nannihilated just yet! We have hope, however faint it may be!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.78,1:29:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But Orlov can't influence the Kremlin any longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.72,1:29:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And Bugarin is a bloodthirsty demon!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.11,1:29:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.37,1:29:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fly to Moscow in person.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.77,1:29:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,John...!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.74,1:29:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll talk it out with Bugarin.\NHe may be a demon, but I'll make him reconsider!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.07,1:29:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down. Your emotions are clouding your mind. Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.73,1:29:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.35,1:29:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one more word!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.47,1:29:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, I won't listen to anything except \Nthe pleas of the people from all around the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.91,1:30:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me water!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.37,1:31:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.88,1:31:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.33,1:31:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to call Tokyo—communications are down.\NThe whole government's been evacuated to Nagoya.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.61,1:31:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything you'd like to tell Laura in case I manage to reach her?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.27,1:31:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really fine with this?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.13,1:31:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you really fine with this...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.75,1:32:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fueling of the orbital carrier rocket, complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.79,1:32:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best, Space Rangers!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.92,1:32:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.91,1:32:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Launching combat satellites.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.58,1:32:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,SR-1, this is the Space Defense's control room.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.34,1:32:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.87,1:32:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}SR-1, Macky Burn speaking.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.56,1:32:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Colonel Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.35,1:32:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be in charge of your mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.14,1:32:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be entering the elliptical orbit within 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.32,1:32:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.69,1:33:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{kinchiten 642 km, enchiten 867 km daen kidou de, 4-ki ga 500 km kankaku de narabimasu}The four satellites will be situated 500 km apart.\NThe orbit will be elliptical, with 642 km perigee and 867 km apogee.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.92,1:33:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll target the ICBMs launched from the Soviet nuclear missile bases\Nwhen they leave the atmosphere, before they begin to accelerate.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.04,1:33:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, to be frank, our interception capabilities are far from ideal.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.18,1:33:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking care of the boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.85,1:33:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's doing just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.93,1:34:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wataru, I saw it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.49,1:34:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The epitome of hell on earth.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.87,1:34:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where did the importance of love vanish to?\NWhat of the value of human lives?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.06,1:35:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wataru, the sunset we saw that day will never come back.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.90,1:35:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet, I want to see you again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.28,1:35:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wish to become a wave. I wish the wind would\Nsweep me away... anything to swiftly reach your side...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.22,1:35:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that really Earth? It used to be so blue, so beautiful...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.66,1:35:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom... Mom...!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.32,1:36:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back, at last... I'm not going anywhere now...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.53,1:36:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always stay by your side...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.42,1:37:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring peace to the Earth! Destroy the devil!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.60,1:37:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring peace to the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.88,1:38:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Lord, have you witnessed this hell on earth?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.66,1:38:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do your children keep falling for\Nthe devil's tricks and straying off your path?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.91,1:38:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, thanks to the Lord's divine providence,\Nour conscience begins to awaken anew.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.00,1:38:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.74,1:38:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray that peace and tranquility be\Nbestowed upon the people all around the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.56,1:38:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.91,1:39:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Albatross speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.42,1:39:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirming the positions of SR-1, SR-2, SR-3, and SR-4 by radar.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.75,1:39:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is SR-1, Macky Burn.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.21,1:39:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Took you long enough, Lloyd. I'm looking forward to your support.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.65,1:39:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to be working with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.92,1:39:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel Macky Burn, this is Mikumo.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.03,1:39:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Any irregularities?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.66,1:39:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, everything's going smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.34,1:39:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jones from the Space Defense HQ speaking.\NAn observation satellite has malfunctioned.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.86,1:39:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to it?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.66,1:39:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apparently, it's been hit by a Soviet killer satellite.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.53,1:39:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.90,1:39:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An emergency message to all the Space Rangers.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.45,1:39:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's a high probability of an enemy\Nkiller satellite attack. Exercise utmost vigilance!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.56,1:39:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Albatross, this is the Space Defense HQ's control room.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.24,1:40:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot provide control after the observation satellite's accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.94,1:40:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Assume control of the Space Rangers using your radar.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.06,1:40:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Albatross speaking. Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.13,1:40:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Multiple enemy killer satellites detected. Closing in.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.34,1:40:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}SR-1. Please provide control.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.74,1:40:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}SR-2, requesting control.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.18,1:40:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,SR-3, SR-4, this concerns you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.42,1:40:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Current distance: 3800 km.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.43,1:40:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Space coordinates: M42, E148, H856.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.12,1:40:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Angular velocity: 36 micro-radians. Tangent, epsilon pattern plus.{角速度 36 マイクロラジアンタンゼント エプシロン パターンでプラス}{TLC, just in case, this is some exquisite technobabble}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.64,1:40:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Closing in now.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.44,1:40:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Target acquired. Distance: 3000 km.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.71,1:40:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Automatic target tracking, locked in.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.16,1:40:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiate the fuel injection!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.04,1:40:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}SR-4, open fire upon the targets crossing the 1500 km mark.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.34,1:40:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}SR-1, open fire in ten seconds.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.83,1:40:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Begin the micro-corrections for the projected target position.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.59,1:41:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.89,1:41:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Albatross speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.25,1:41:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A new wave of the killer satellites closing in. Distance: 4500 km.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.94,1:41:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,SR-1 through SR-4, continue the operation. Maintain combat readiness.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.32,1:41:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.28,1:41:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy killer satellite incoming! Collision imminent!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.87,1:41:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,SR-4 has been hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.86,1:41:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.16,1:42:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Both SR-3 and SR-2 have been hit.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.30,1:42:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the Space Defense HQ's control room.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.50,1:42:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Albatross, assess the situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.83,1:42:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Albatross speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.60,1:42:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,SR-2, SR-3, and SR-4 have been lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.99,1:42:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see SR-1 on the radars?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.43,1:42:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Albatross, SR-1 speaking. We need refueling.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.43,1:42:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Colonel Macky Burn?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.40,1:42:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Minor damage to the outer hull.\NNothing to be concerned about.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.81,1:42:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up. We may come under another attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.61,1:42:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Macky Burn is right.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.75,1:42:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy has complete space supremacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.26,1:42:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the nuclear attack response plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.52,1:43:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger. Preparing to dock with SR-1.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.20,1:43:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru, your precise targeting system is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.75,1:43:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.87,1:43:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's a matter of course for a scientist.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.51,1:43:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain! The second wave of killer satellites is approaching!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.60,1:43:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance: 2000 km.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.68,1:43:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru, run! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.45,1:43:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Laser cannon, standing by to fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.25,1:43:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.30,1:44:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.71,1:45:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy the devil!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.13,1:45:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring peace to the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.37,1:45:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy the devil! Bring peace—
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.16,1:45:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kutuzov, who ordered your release from prison?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.56,1:45:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jail-breaking is punishable by firing squad.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.50,1:45:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Our countrymen effected my release.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.42,1:45:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bugarin, why won't you agree to a\N personal meeting with President Gibson?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.08,1:45:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,America's fighting spirit is completely broken. Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.27,1:45:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Even space supremacy is ours now!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.37,1:45:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Within the next 30 minutes, our territory will be increased\Nthree-fold. We'll control half of the Earth's population.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.02,1:45:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, the balance of energy and provisions will be\Nreached. Humanity will enter a new age of prosperity!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.83,1:45:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reasoning is truly demonic.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.17,1:45:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Lord, forgive my sins.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.67,1:46:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you too, Kozlov...!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.60,1:46:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Comrade Bugarin. Issue a ceasefire order to all the troops,\Nthen attend the peace conference with the American President.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.07,1:46:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.60,1:46:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All across Europe, the Middle East, and Asia,\Nthe frontline troops have voluntarily abandoned their arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.03,1:46:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They've begun to retreat from the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.54,1:46:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The citizens of our subordinate republics\Nare gathering in Moscow, demanding peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.65,1:46:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't their voices reach through to you?!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.65,1:46:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you all gone insane?!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.50,1:46:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In the 70 years since the revolution, have our\Ncomrades been spilling their blood and sweat for nothing?!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.86,1:46:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Glory is within our grasp!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.38,1:46:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll personally force you to acknowledge reality!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.93,1:46:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.94,1:47:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't override it...\NThe override system has already been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.16,1:47:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory is mine, in the end...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.05,1:47:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Launch of the enemy missiles, confirmed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.35,1:47:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Neumann. Soviet Foreign Minister​ Kutuzov\Nhas just informed us about a terrible accident.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.81,1:47:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The launch switch for the second wave\Nof missiles has been pressed by accident.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.49,1:47:41.16,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do not lose hope, and do everything\Nwithin your power to minimize the damages.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.16,1:47:45.49,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fortunately, a Soviet scientific satellite has\Nbeen redirected to provide you with information.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.00,1:47:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Albatross!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.07,1:47:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Albatross, this is the Vandenberg Control Room. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.31,1:47:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Albatross. Lloyd speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.18,1:48:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wataru is alive, though wounded. Smith didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.71,1:48:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The oxygen supply system's malfunctioning. \NRegrettably, we are forced to return to base.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.28,1:48:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.05,1:48:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, we still have the SR-1!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.66,1:48:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru, you won't make it!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.14,1:48:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come within 100 meters of the SR-1. I'll handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.30,1:48:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can return afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.76,1:48:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru, don't be so rash!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.61,1:48:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru! Do you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.32,1:48:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Space Rangers exist to counter ICBMs, Chief Brown.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.99,1:48:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bart would be disappointed if I turned back now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.44,1:48:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,SR-1, Macky Burn, come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.26,1:48:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Macky Burn, come in!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.56,1:48:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they dead, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.93,1:48:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel, keep trying to establish contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.21,1:48:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,SR-1, come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.82,1:48:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,SR-1!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.28,1:48:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Jones of the Space Defense HQ.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.62,1:48:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Albatross!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.36,1:48:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But who's that man?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.59,1:49:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A crew member from Albatross.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.84,1:49:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His name is Wataru Mikumo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.34,1:49:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An employee of my Future Research Institute.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.88,1:49:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A scientist?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.40,1:49:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mikumo, this is Colonel Jones of the Space Defense HQ.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.75,1:49:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.78,1:50:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikumo... Regrettably, outgoing\Ntransmission from you appears to be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.82,1:50:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we can see you clearly.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.34,1:50:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please answer my queries with a "yes" or a "no."
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.82,1:50:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This will do. Let's begin now.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.84,1:50:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Have Captain Macky Burn and his crew been killed in action?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.97,1:50:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,General Neumann speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.80,1:50:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the engine and the laser cannon of the SR-1 operational?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.25,1:50:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Brown, can he operate the Space Ranger?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.35,1:50:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He can.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.01,1:50:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.36,1:50:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sir, is it wise to let a civilian operate a combat satellite?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.93,1:50:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no other choice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.41,1:50:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.08,1:50:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they trying to rope Wataru into?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.58,1:50:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He isn't a soldier!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.76,1:50:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What do they expect him to accomplish?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.17,1:51:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.86,1:51:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.91,1:51:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen well, Mikumo.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.70,1:51:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,To keep it short—ten minutes ago, eight SS-18\NICBMs were launched from an East Siberian missile base.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.67,1:51:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Their targets are Seattle, Los Angeles, \NSan Francisco, and San Diego on the West Coast.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.49,1:51:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Space Rangers, aside from your SR-1,\Nhave been taken out by the killer satellites.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.26,1:51:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Presently, the aforementioned eight\NICBMs are the only ones to have been launched.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.97,1:51:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Approximately 30 million people live on the West Coast.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.17,1:51:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, only your Ranger remains.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.80,1:51:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the SR-1 still operational?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.43,1:52:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikumo, this is Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.86,1:52:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be providing control for you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.57,1:52:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Over ten minutes have\Npassed since the ICBMs were launched.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.47,1:52:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to hit them on the downward trajectory. This is an extremely complicated task.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.74,1:52:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awful! You're all trying to kill Wataru!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.71,1:52:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He only has a portable oxygen supply!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.82,1:52:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't last him over two hours!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.58,1:52:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.09,1:52:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru. it's me, Laura.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.35,1:52:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.48,1:52:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally came back from Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.48,1:52:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.77,1:52:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you with all of my being.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.10,1:52:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the sunset we saw together?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.88,1:52:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That bright red sunset...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.69,1:52:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.01,1:52:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like us to see a sunset together, again.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.08,1:52:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mikumo, the targets have been detected.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.28,1:53:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Space coordinates: M50, E188, H925, B102.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.92,1:53:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Angular velocity: 42 micro-radians.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.12,1:53:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,SR-1, lock onto the targets. Begin tracking.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.27,1:53:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire within three minutes. Estimated distance: 2000 km.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.98,1:53:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Opening fire in one minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.10,1:53:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Proceeding to inject fuel.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.61,1:53:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ICBMs closing in. Distance: 2000 km.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.23,1:54:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.14,1:54:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.57,1:54:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.43,1:54:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.34,1:54:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it...!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.40,1:54:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job, Mikumo. Six missiles intercepted.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.31,1:54:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One more deviated from orbit. It'll land in the Pacific Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.46,1:54:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin return maneuvers. \NYou must be running low on oxygen by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.63,1:55:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikumo!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.05,1:55:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I greatly respect your courage and sense of responsibility,\Nbut there's no stopping the one remaining missile.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.15,1:55:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if you began firing preparations now, \Nit'll re-enter the atmosphere within five minutes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.56,1:55:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Intercepting it from space is impossible!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.47,1:55:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru's actually going to do it... He's not backing down.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.60,1:55:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But how does he intend to accomplish this?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.85,1:55:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The laser's efficiency sharply falls within the atmosphere.\NHe'll have to draw close, and open fire just before contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.34,1:55:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wataru won't survive such a maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.59,1:55:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?! Hurry up and stop Wataru!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.97,1:55:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief, please let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.03,1:55:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.73,1:55:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Begin the launch preparations without delay!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.99,1:55:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Laura. What do you think you're going to accomplish?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.09,1:56:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rescue Wataru!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.15,1:56:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What an insane idea...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.99,1:56:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Laura. While I see where you're coming from,\Nwe have no flight-ready space shuttles.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.99,1:56:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the manned satellites?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.36,1:56:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Air Force has one, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.25,1:56:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.37,1:56:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Every minute matters! Empty arguments won't get us anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.55,1:56:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.42,1:56:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me go to Wataru! Please! Don't stop me!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.96,1:56:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.23,1:58:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Baikal! Baikal! This is Kutuzov from the Kremlin!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.08,1:58:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Currently, an American manned satellite is \Ndescending out of control 104 degrees off L2...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.99,1:58:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Currently, an American manned satellite is \Ndescending out of control 104 degrees off L2...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.17,1:58:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...at an altitude of 350 km above Canberra, Australia.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.42,1:58:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Begin a rescue operation immediately!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.85,1:58:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wataru...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.81,1:59:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can you hear it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.45,1:59:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The chanting of all the people on Earth?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.37,1:59:13.85,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,Destroy the devil! Bring peace to the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.09,1:59:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The voices of all the people whose lives you've saved?{\i0}{lib}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.12,1:59:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy the devil! Bring peace to the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.99,1:59:30.24,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,Destroy the devil! Bring peace to the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.49,1:59:48.39,Default (Top),,0,0,0,,Destroy the devil! Bring peace to the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.76,1:59:55.18,TL Note,,0,0,0,,TL Note: Hiroshima Peace Memorial
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.38,2:00:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wataru...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.14,2:00:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.24,2:00:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just a while longer...
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.35,2:00:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just a while longer until I embrace you...
