Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.40,2:01:10.00,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Moshimo anata to wakareta naraba\N(If we happen to drift apart)
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.32,2:01:21.10,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Watashi ni asa wa nidoto wa konai\N(There will be no more future for me)
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.63,2:01:31.45,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Kono yo wa yami ni tozasarete\N(Darkness will envelop the world)
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.20,2:01:43.38,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Ai no hikari mo kieteyuku wa\N(And the shine of love will fade away)
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.38,2:01:58.66,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Watashi no inochi wa anata dake ni ageta mono\N(My life is meant to be yours, and yours alone)
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.66,2:02:06.07,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Umareta toki kara kimatteita no yo\N(So has been decided the moment I was born)
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.07,2:02:17.31,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Ai no sadame ni musubarete\N(The fate of love tied us together)
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.31,2:02:27.96,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Futari nara yukeru wa\N(With you by my side)
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.19,2:02:34.24,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Sekai no hate made\N(I'll readily travel to the ends of the world)
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.33,2:03:02.93,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Ai wo sakarete shimatta naraba\N(If our love happens to be torn apart)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.21,2:03:13.99,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Watashi ni shine to iu koto nano yo\N(That would spell a certain death for me)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.52,2:03:24.34,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Nozomi mo yume mo karehatete\N(My hopes and dreams would wither and fade)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.10,2:03:36.29,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Kaze no manimani chitteyuku wa\N(Until the wind blows them away)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.29,2:03:51.51,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Namida ga afureru anata no koto wo omou toki\N(My tears well up whenever I think of you)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.51,2:03:58.98,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Watashi no subete wo sono te de idaite\N(I wish you embraced me firmly)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.98,2:04:10.26,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Ai no kizuna ni tsunagarete\N(The bonds of love connect us)
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.26,2:04:21.11,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Futari nara yukeru wa\N(With you by my side)
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.11,2:04:27.49,Singing (TOP),,0,0,0,,Sekai no hate made\N(I'll readily travel to the ends of the world)
